# 7. Most Important Innovation/USP Features

The product should focus its presentation around five major ideas:

## 1. AI Receipt Intelligence

Messy receipts/invoices → structured expense data.

## 2. Policy Guardian

Automatically identify policy violations.

## 3. Smart Approval Engine

Combine:

* Expense
* Policy
* Budget
* Employee history
* Risk

to recommend the appropriate review level.

## 4. Predictive Budget Guardian

Don't just report current spending.

Predict whether the department is heading toward budget overspending.

## 5. Budget Impact Simulator + Finance Copilot

Allow management to ask:

> "What happens if I approve this?"

and:

> "What is happening with our budgets?"

