Preferred pitch:

> **"An AI-powered financial control platform that evaluates every expense against company policy, employee behavior, and real-time budget conditions—then predicts the financial impact before approval."**

Strong one-line USP:

> **"We don't just track expenses—we understand their impact before organizations approve them."**

Another strong statement:

> **"AI analyzes. Humans decide."**

