# 10. Simplified Architecture

```text
                 React + TSX
                      │
                      ▼
                   FastAPI
                      │
          ┌───────────┼────────────┐
          │           │            │
          ▼           ▼            ▼
      Supabase      LLM APIs    AI/ML Logic
       Postgres                    │
          │                        │
