# 29. What Should NOT Be Added Yet

For the simplified hackathon MVP, do NOT overengineer the database with tables like:

```text
ai_models
llm_prompts
forecast_models
expense_embeddings
anomaly_scores
budget_predictions
vendors
```

The MVP can handle AI output using:

```text
expenses.ai_analysis JSONB
```

Budget calculations can be generated from:

```text
budgets
+
expenses
```

Forecasting can be calculated by FastAPI/Python.

